DESCRIPTION:Hi everyone\,<br><br>thank you so much for agreeing to prese
 nt at the Leadership meeting today.<br><br>I'm setting up this 20 minute
 s in advance of the meeting for you to join us to say hello\, test prese
 nt stuff and to check in on anything you need (current RSVPs\, Q&amp\;A 
 preferences etc)<br><br>The below meeting link can be used to join at 3.
 40 but it's ALSO the meeting link for the meeting itself. It will be sen
 t to current 'yes' responding RSVPs 1-2 hours prior to the meeting.<br><
 br><br><a href="https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/47182275741828?p=hW1iRQ
 B33O5NSHEvPQ" target="_blank" dir="auto">Moreton Bay Leadership Meeting 
 - Q2\, 2026 | Meeting-Join | Microsoft Teams</a><br><br>Any questions gi
 ve me a bell. I look forward to seeing you on Thursday. :)<br>Katie
