DESCRIPTION:Dear Kathy and David\,\n\nThank you for delivering Orientati
 on (FC) – Diploma in Animal Ecology.\n\nThis Outlook invitation will ser
 ve as the most up-to-date point of reference for your session time and l
 ocation. Please RSVP ‘Accepted’ to confirm your attendance and delivery 
 of this session.\n\nA guide to the Program Welcome Session can be found 
 here: Orientation Program Welcome info.pdf<https://usceduau.sharepoint.c
 om/:b:/r/sites/orientation/Shared%20Documents/Sunshine%20Coast/26T2/Prog
 ram/Academic%20info/Orientation%20Program%20Welcome%20info.pdf?csf=1&web
 =1&e=1tY0ct>\n\nWe ask that you please use the new Orientation presentat
 ion template\, which includes the updated Acknowledgement of Country\, s
 upport services\, and student portal slides. The presentation can be fou
 nd here: Orientation presentation template.potx<https://usceduau.sharepo
 int.com/:p:/s/orientation/IQA01QudaWX5QZ28TbIwVlr3AWTU4Ar-3Ps0Fl_-s8ZkFY
 Y?email=GG_Users_All-Active-Staff_Automated%40usc.edu.au&e=4qsHDZ>\n\nIf
  you experience any issues or require assistance on your Orientation day
 \, please contact: Katie Nicoll – 0414 712 443\n\nIf you are no longer a
 ble to deliver this session\, please contact orientation@usc.edu.au<mail
 to:orientation@usc.edu.au> and your program coordinator and/or disciplin
 e lead as soon as possible.\n\n \nKind regards\,\nKC\n\nKC Fedotova (she
 /her/hers)\nStudent Communications and Events Assistant\nStudent Service
 s\nUniversity of the Sunshine Coast\nTel: 07 5456 5390\nkfedotova@usc.ed
 u.au<mailto:kfedotova@usc.edu.au>  | unisc.edu.au<https://aus01.safelink
 s.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.unisc.edu.au%2F&data=05%7
 C02%7Cdschoema%40usc.edu.au%7C89324ee97c604675ad9e08debad3ee6e%7C93b0ec5
 0fc3f47ed93459ffc6012541c%7C0%7C0%7C639153616567985152%7CUnknown%7CTWFpb
 GZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOI
 joiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=AwCE0%2FHTSH2r7FkFms6HrFQ
 ActC5facJZgER2VjJ7Is%3D&reserved=0>\n[University of the Sunshine Coast A
 ustralia]\nThe University acknowledges the Traditional Custodians \nof t
 he land on which we live\, work and study. We pay our \nrespects to loca
 l Indigenous Elders past\, present and emerging \nand recognise the stre
 ngth\, resilience and capacity of all \nAboriginal and Torres Strait Isl
 ander people. \n \nCRICOS Provider Number: 01595D\n\n
