DESCRIPTION:Good morning\,\n\nWe would like to invite you to attend the 
 HDR Final Thesis Seminar of Alice Pidd\, a Doctor of Philosophy candidat
 e in the School of Science\, Technology and Engineering.\n\nThe title of
  the research is “Exploring climate-smart marine protected areas network
 s for Australia”.   A copy of the Abstract and Bio is attached for furth
 er details on the research.\n\nPrincipal Supervisor: Kylie Scales\nCo Su
 pervisors: David Schoeman\, Anthony Richardson\n\nThis room\, SD.I.G.09 
 (Lecture Theatre 4)\, is Zoom capable and participants can either Zoom i
 n or attend in person.\n\nIn the event of any IT issues\, please follow 
 these instructions:\n\n  1.  Dial 2 on the room phone\, followed by the 
 call or send option on the telephone handset provided in the room. This 
 will connect you directly to IT on-call support.\n  2.  Alternatively\, 
 you can dial 5430 1237.\n\nUniSC participants can find information about
  the Final Thesis Presentation<https://studentportal.usc.edu.au/my-hdr/t
 hesis/final-thesis-seminar> on the Student Portal.\n\nPlease forward thi
 s invite on to anyone who may have been missed.\n\n\nKind regards\,\nTra
 cy\n\nTracy Buchanan\nAdministration Officer – Program Support\nE Buildi
 ng (E2.18)\nAcademic Support Unit\nUniversity of the Sunshine Coast\, Lo
 cked Bag 4\, Maroochydore DC\, Queensland\, 4558 Australia.\nPh: +61 754
 56 3865 | Email: TBuchanan1@usc.edu.au<mailto:TBuchanan1@usc.edu.au> | W
 eb: www.usc.edu.au<http://www.usc.edu.au>\nCRICOS Provider No: 01595D\n[
 University of the Sunshine Coast Australia]\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n[USC Logo
 ]<https://www.usc.edu.au/>\n[Zoom Logo]<https://aus01.safelinks.protecti
 on.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fusc-au.zoom.us%2F&data=05%7C02%7Cdscho
